sequenceDiagram
  participant A as Admin
  participant Q as SystemJob
  participant W as Worker writer lane
  participant D as PostgreSQL
  participant N as NFS media
  participant C as Isolated probe child
  participant App as Next App service
  participant UI as Artwork UI
  A->>Q: Start manual probe
  Q->>W: Claim with execution fence
  loop Continuous pages of at most 100 animated Image IDs
    W->>D: Read animated WebP candidates
    D-->>W: Path, revision, status
    W->>C: Probe request with 60 s deadline
    C->>N: stat path and handle before read
    C->>N: Parse bounded RIFF headers
    C->>N: stat path and handle after read
    C-->>W: Duration, frames, loop or static/error and stats
    W->>D: Fenced transaction: path + revision + gate + stats CAS
    D-->>W: Published or stale result rejected
    W->>Q: Publish progress; check pause/cancel
  end
  UI->>App: Authenticated artwork or viewer request
  App->>D: Batch join valid READY metadata
  D-->>App: Source-bound result
  App-->>UI: Nullable safe-number DTO
